      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think organizing this document as workflows might be easier to digest by the user.\n\nSomething like:\n### Building and flashing local EC images\nLocal EC changes might add new strings, so here\u0027s how to ensure your new strings are decoded correctly.\n  * Build the EC image as normal (zmake build...)\n  * Board specific database and unified database info\n  * Starting servod (maybe link to the content you already have)\n  * Flashing EC\n  \n### Building EC images with ebuild\n  * *Where is the token database found under /build/\u003cboard\u003e?*\n  * *Does the user need to update servod?\n  \n### Using pre-built images\n  * *How does user update database?  Do they even need to update the database?*",
